OL,3,GNEWSACharity seeks pet lovers to help
OL,4,A'capacity crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople seeking to adopt a pet in Surrey
OL,7,Fare needed to help with what the UK's
OL,8,Flargest animal welfare charity has
OL,9,Fcalled a "capacity crisis".
OL,11,FThe RSPCA said its rescue teams had
OL,12,Fbeen overwhelmed with saving multiple
OL,13,Fanimals - and in one case 250 dogs -
OL,14,Fhoused at single addresses.
OL,16,FThere have been 34 reported
OL,17,Fmulti-animal cases in Surrey between
OL,18,FJanuary and August this year, with a
OL,19,Ftotal of 3,280 across England and Wales
OL,20,Fin the same timespan, according to the
OL,21,Fcharity.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
