OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACharity seeks pet lovers to help
OL,4,A'capacity crisis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJo Rowland, RSPCA chief executive,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We currently have more animals
OL,8,Fin our care than space in our centres
OL,9,Fand branches - it's a heart-breaking
OL,10,Fsituation."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
